From the last step, we extract unified features from the source code
and the binaries, they can be considered as sorted sequences of
feature sets, i.e.,


[( _𝑖𝑑𝑥_ 1 _,𝑆_ 1 ) _,_ ( _𝑖𝑑𝑥_ 2 _,𝑆_ 2 ) _,_ ( _𝑖𝑑𝑥_ 3 _,𝑆_ 3 ) · · · ]


