In this paper, we aim to answer the following four research ques
tions:

**RQ.1** **(Effectiveness)** How accurate is the patch presence test
framework compared to previous work?
**RQ.2** **(Efficiency)** How efficient is the patch presence test framework, especially when dealing with large code repositories?
**RQ.3** **(Ablation Study)** How do the analyses described in Section 3.2.3 contribute to the overall effectiveness?
**RQ.4** **(In-the-wild Evaluation)** Can our approach analyze opensource libraries in real-world applications?


